msgstr "Setup ng Mythic Track para sa %(guild)s"

#, python-format
msgctxt "admin.mythic_track_on"
msgid ""
"✅ Mythic Track has been turned **on** for this server!\n"
"\n"
"To continue setup, please [connect your Discord account to Mythic Track](%(guide)s).\n"
"\n"
"While this feature is turned on, SpellBot will generate PIN codes for players to enter into Mythic Track so that their games can be tracked."
msgstr ""
"✅ **Na-on** ang Mythic Track para sa server na ito!\n"
"\n"
"Para ipagpatuloy ang setup, [ikonekta ang Discord account mo sa Mythic Track](%(guide)s).\n"
"\n"
"Habang naka-on ang feature na ito, bubuo ang SpellBot ng mga PIN code para makapasok ang mga player sa Mythic Track para ma-track ang kanilang mga game."

msgctxt "admin.mythic_track_off"
msgid "❌ Mythic Track has been turned **off** for this server. Rerun this command to toggle it back on. Note that turning this feature off does _not_ remove any existing Mythic Track data."
msgstr "❌ **Na-off** ang Mythic Track para sa server na ito. I-run ulit ang command na ito para mai-on ulit. Tandaan na kahit i-off ang feature na ito, hindi maaalis ang anumang kasalukuyang data ng Mythic Track."

