#, python-format
msgctxt "about.description"
msgid ""
"_The Discord bot for Webcam Magic._\n"
"\n"
"Having issues with SpellBot? Please [report bugs](%(issues)s)!\n"
"\n"
"[🔗 Add SpellBot to your Discord!](%(invite)s)\n"
"\n"
"SpellBot's continued operation is made possible by [PlayEDH](https://www.playedh.com/) and my Patreon supporters.\n"
"\n"
"💜 Help keep SpellBot running by [becoming a patron!](%(patreon)s)"
msgstr ""
"_Ang Discord bot para sa Webcam Magic._\n"
"\n"
"Nagkakaproblema ka ba sa SpellBot? [I-report ang mga bug](%(issues)s)!\n"
"\n"
"[🔗 Idagdag ang SpellBot sa Discord mo!](%(invite)s)\n"
"\n"
"Naging posible ang patuloy na pagpapatakbo ng SpellBot dahil sa [PlayEDH](https://www.playedh.com/) at sa mga Patreon supporter ko.\n"
"\n"
"💜 Tumulong na panatilihing gumagana ang SpellBot sa pamamagitan ng [pagiging patron!](%(patreon)s)"

